Keyword “this”-> is the reference to an object that is the trigger for the event:
- on message
- on envVar
- on key
- on errorframeù
- on BusOff…
The Keyword “this” is a sort of pointer to an object
Example:
on message 555
{
byte val;
val = 0;
if (this.CAN == 1)
// if the message is received on CAN 1
{
val = this.byte(0);
// “val” is equal to the first byte of CAN message payload
}

